---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page
  title="Flood Depth"
  description="Flood Depth maps flood extent, depth, probability and exposed assets anywhere on Earth from a free global DEM, built by Simon Maps in Nairobi, Kenya."
  path="/flood-depth"
  eyebrow="Flood mapping tool"
>
  <p class="lede">Flood exposure from terrain alone: map flood extent, depth, probability and exposed assets anywhere on Earth.</p>

  <h2>What it does</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Flood extent and depth estimated from a free global DEM using HAND and synthetic rating curves</li>
    <li>Flood probability and exposed assets for any area you search, draw, or pick from examples</li>
    <li>Runs in the browser, with no local GIS software or data downloads needed</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="actions">
    <a href="https://flood.simonmapper.co.ke/" class="btn btn-solid">Open Flood Depth</a>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn">Discuss a project</a>
  </div>
</Page>
